In this project, I implemented a Doubly Linked List using C++.
* Created a node structure with data, previous, and next pointers.
* Implemented insertion at the beginning of the doubly linked list.
* Added functionality to insert nodes at a specific position.
* Implemented deletion of nodes from a specified position.
* Added forward traversal to display all elements in the list.
* Implemented reverse traversal using the previous pointers.
* Managed both head and tail pointers for efficient operations.
* Handled invalid positions and empty list scenarios.
* Practiced dynamic memory allocation and pointer manipulation.
* Tested different linked list operations to ensure correct functionality.
This project helped me understand doubly linked list operations, bidirectional traversal, memory management, and data structure implementation in C++.
